          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Borthwick names Ben Curry and George Furbank in England side for Wallabies",
          "body": "Ben Curry starts at openside against Australia, his Test return after an injury-hit 16 months, with Guy Pepper ruled out by an ankle injury sustained in Bath's defeat at Gloucester. George Furbank returns at full-back, Marcus Smith drops to the bench, and Fin Baxter starts at loosehead ahead of Ellis Genge. Maro Itoje is restored to the captaincy, and Exeter's Greg Fisilau is poised to win his first cap from the bench. Tom Curry misses the matchday 23 after an injury setback in training."
