          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Galthié reunites Dupont and Ntamack as France's half-back pairing against Fiji",
          "body": "Coach Fabien Galthié has named Antoine Dupont at scrum-half and Romain Ntamack at flyhalf for Saturday's match in Lyon, their first start together at half-back since March 2025. Ntamack's injury record includes a long-running kidney problem, while Dupont missed the whole of July with a calf issue. Matthieu Jalibert is out with a quadriceps problem, and Maxime Lucu is among the replacements. Fiji, coached by Jake White, scored no points in July, losing 39-24 to Wales and 73-8 to England."
