          "kicker": "Injury worries",
          "heading": "Andy Farrell faces injury worries after Dan Sheehan fails head assessment",
          "body": "Captain Dan Sheehan was forced off in the first half of Friday's 42-12 win over Argentina after failing a head injury assessment, though Andy Farrell said he \"seems fine in the dressing room\". Robert Baloucoune also left with a knock in the 58th minute, while Sean Jansen took a \"bang\" to his knee and Josh van der Flier and Mack Hansen both have ankle concerns. Hansen continued after treatment."
