          "heading": "Nacho Brex calls Springboks' De Allende and Kriel probably the best pairing",
          "body": "Italy's vice-captain Juan Ignacio Brex, sidelined for Saturday's match, has praised Damian de Allende and Jesse Kriel. \"They're probably the best centre partnership in the world,\" he told Planet Rugby exclusively. Brex, who detached a bicep in the last Top 14 round and expects surgery next week, said he and Tommaso Menoncello see the South African pair as a benchmark to challenge. Menoncello, who faces 12 weeks out after subluxing his shoulder for Toulouse against Exeter Chiefs in the Champions Cup, is also out."
