          "body": "Olympic silver medallist Josh Kerr will deliver the match ball to the middle of the Murrayfield pitch before Saturday's Test, and he has already been inside the camp. He joined the squad for Friday's captain's run and a lunch session on high performance, and told the Telegraph he would \"look awful\" on the pitch, joking that his speed would let him down. His brother Jake won a full cap at hooker for Scotland in 2019."
