          "heading": "Bath sign Argentina tight-head prop Marcos Camerlinckx, Super Rugby Americas champion",
          "body": "Marcos Camerlinckx, a 22-year-old tight-head prop and former Argentina Under-20 international, joins Bath after winning this year's Super Rugby Americas Championship with Pampas XV. He also played for an Argentina XV against the United States in August. Bath director of rugby Johann van Graan told the club website: \"We are looking forward to seeing how Marcos will develop his game over the next period of time and I am sure he will fit into our group very well.\" Bath have not disclosed the length of the deal."
